[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-brainlolly-undergraduate-scholarship-up-to-3-million-awards-172":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},172,"2026-brainlolly-undergraduate-scholarship-up-to-3-million-awards-172","2026 Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship | Up To ₦3 Million Awards","\u003Cp>BrainLolly, a quiz to cash platform has opened application for its 2026 Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Apply now and take the next step in your academic journey.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: BrainLolly\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 30, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Brainlolly was founded in the year 2021. Its initiative focuses on rewarding exceptional performance, addressing the adverse mindset of youth about education and creativity, nurturing a greater pool of talent worldwide\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship is an initiative for Nigerian undergraduates aimed at promoting academic excellence and rewarding students\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Scholarship is often facilitated through quiz contests and IQ development. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship 2.0 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition Fee\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the 2026 Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Training programs\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants must be tertiary students studying in any recognised Nigerian tertiary institution\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have strong academic record\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents for Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>6While applying for the 2026 Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>School ID\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Brainlolly Undergraduate Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Brainlolly Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the online application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbrainlolly.com\u002Fscholarship\u002F1\u002Fapply\">https:\u002F\u002Fbrainlolly.com\u002Fscholarship\u002F1\u002Fapply\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-22 10:50:37",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-brainlolly-undergraduate-scholarship-up-to-3-million-awards\u002F69e899edcd1aa2.43321333_screenshot 2026-04-22 104620.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-brainlolly-undergraduate-scholarship-up-to-3-million-awards\u002F69e899edcd1aa2.43321333_screenshot%202026-04-22%20104620.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",1,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":48},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":45,"oldFileName":45,"type":18,"file":19,"url":46},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u